  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nfor _ in range(int(input())):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    l=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    l.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    p=[0]*(3*n+1)\r\n    for i in range(3*n):\r\n        p[i+1]=p[i]+l[i]\r\n    ans=0\r\n    \r\n    for a in range(n+1):\r\n        mx=n-a\r\n        lo=0\r\n        h=mx\r\n        \r\n        while lo<h:\r\n            mid=(lo+h+1)//2\r\n            b=mid-1\r\n            v=a+2*b\r\n            w=3*n-2*a-b\r\n            \r\n            de=l[v]+l[v+1]-3*l[w-1]\r\n            \r\n            if de>=0:\r\n                lo=mid\r\n            else: \r\n                h=mid-1\r\n        for b in {lo,min(mx,lo+1)}:\r\n            c=n-a-b\r\n            v=a+2*b\r\n            w=3*n-2*a-b\r\n             \r\n            cur=3*p[w]+p[v]+2*p[a]\r\n            ans=max(ans,cur)\r\n            \r\n    print(ans)        ",
